pr     "Linkbox #13" files 4
title  "Docker and CI"
by     "Maya" with "Claude Code"
ask    "Add a Dockerfile and a GitHub Actions workflow that runs the tests on every push."
did    "A Node 25 container image, and a workflow that runs the tests on every push and pull request. App code untouched."

show pipeline .github/workflows/test.yml "What runs on every push"
show recipe   Dockerfile                  "What the image is built from"
show same "What the app replies to GET /api/links" GET /api/links

code  app     "App"
code  storage "Storage"
store file    "Links file"
test  tests   "Tests"
app -> storage
storage -> file
tests -> app

+ config image "Image" "A container image. One command starts Linkbox."
    said "Use node:25-alpine, we run 25 everywhere else."
    pin row "node:25-alpine"
    proof Dockerfile:2
+ image -> app
    proof Dockerfile:20
+ config workflow "Workflow" "Tests run on every push and pull request."
    said "And also run the workflow on pull requests."
    pin step "npm test"
    proof .github/workflows/test.yml:3
+ workflow -> tests
    proof .github/workflows/test.yml:13
= app "The app itself. Not one line changed."
    said "Don't touch the app code."
    pin same 1
    proof test adds and lists links
    proof test deletes a link
! image "Build and start the container once. Nobody has yet."
    pin row "VOLUME /data"
    proof Dockerfile:16
! workflow "Watch the first GitHub run. It hasn't run anywhere."
    pin step "setup-node"
    proof .github/workflows/test.yml:10
smaller "Keep tests and local data out of the image" files .dockerignore
